900	      <p class="section-desc">Cross-cutting — applies to all button types. The spinner uses <code>currentColor</code> so it works on every variant without extra colour tokens.</p>
901	
902	      <div class="live-demo" style="flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px;">
903	        <button class="btn btn-primary is-loading" disabled>
